  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• To a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Cut carrot and bamboo shoots (see ingredients) into bite-sized chunks.\n• Pick curry leaves.\n• Place carrot and bamboo shoots on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6541d38b1cefd62c18e5a063-e1435579.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a medium saucepan, heat the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook curry leaves until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Add basmati rice, the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt, stir, then bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat and keep covered until the rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6541d38b1cefd62c18e5a063-116c2df9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies have 10 minutes remaining, drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into bite-sized chunks.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, cook haloumi, tossing occasionally, until golden brown, 2-4 minutes. Transfer to a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6541d38b1cefd62c18e5a063-7b55d78b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook mild curry paste, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in light cooking cream and the water (for the curry), until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6541d38b1cefd62c18e5a063-2c2fd378.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add cooked haloumi, roast veggies and baby spinach leaves to the pan. Cook until wilted and combined, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6541d38b1cefd62c18e5a063-4206c1e4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide curry leaf rice between bowls.\n• Top with haloumi and roast veggie korma curry.\n• Sprinkle with flaked almonds and a dollop of Greek-style yoghurt to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6541d38b1cefd62c18e5a063-68339bb5.jpeg"
    }
  ]
